<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine mutual fund assets up 274 pct July-July.</title>
<headline>Argentine mutual fund assets up 274 pct July-July.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine mutual funds' assets rose to $4.68 billion in July, a jump of 274 percent from the same month a year earlier, the Argentine Chamber of Mutual Funds said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Compared with a month earlier, there was a rise of 18.5 percent in the funds' assets.</p>
<p>A year earlier, their assets stood at $1.25 billion.</p>
<p>((--Walter Bianchi, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0651))</p>
